只有一个错。`CompositeExtractOp::create` 要的是 `ArrayRef<int32_t>`，不是 `ArrayAttr`,我给的形式过时了。

改一行：

````bash
cat > /tmp/fixup2.py <<'PYEOF'
import sys, os
SRC = "mlir/lib/Conversion/VectorToSPIRV/VectorToSPIRV.cpp"
if not os.path.isfile(SRC):
    sys.exit("error: run from the root of your llvm-project checkout")
s = open(SRC).read()

OLD = """        Value element = spirv::CompositeExtractOp::create(
            rewriter, loc, adaptor.getValueToStore(),
            rewriter.getI32ArrayAttr({static_cast<int32_t>(i)}));"""
NEW = """        Value element = spirv::CompositeExtractOp::create(
            rewriter, loc, adaptor.getValueToStore(),
            ArrayRef<int32_t>{static_cast<int32_t>(i)});"""

n = s.count(OLD)
if n != 1:
    sys.exit("error: matched %d times, expected 1" % n)
open(SRC, "w").write(s.replace(OLD, NEW))
print("fixed " + SRC)
PYEOF
python3 /tmp/fixup2.py && ninja -C build mlir-opt
````

那个重载是 `create(builder, location, composite, ArrayRef<int32_t> indices)`,result type 它自己推。

编译输出发我。
